NERS, are you ready?!\nGive it your best showing! Let's appeal!"]},{"at":[15,22],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestJudge","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_CONTEST_JUDGE","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_JUDGE","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["JUDGE: Are you enjoying this CONTEST?\nCome back with three friends, and all of you may enter a CONTEST!"]},{"at":[10,25],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestant1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BLACK_BELT","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_CONTESTANT_1","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Ayayayay… I entered the wrong CONTEST.\nI entered this tough POKéMON in the SMARTNESS CONTEST…\nCome on, wow them with a smart-looking ROCK SMASH."]},{"at":[12,25],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestant2","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_EXPERT_M","source_id":7,"local_id":7,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_CONTESTANT_2","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["I've spent many a year, and all my wisdom besides, raising this POKéMON to be smart.\nIt won't be easily bested by some young pup's POKéMON.\nMy dear wife, are you seeing this?"]},{"at":[14,25],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestant3","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_MANIAC","source_id":8,"local_id":8,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_CONTESTANT_3","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["There it is!\nIf my POKéMON pulls a smart move next, the audience's excitement will peak!"]},{"at":[16,25],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestant4","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_LINK_RECEPTIONIST","source_id":9,"local_id":9,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_CONTESTANT_4","facing":"up","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_UP","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Oh, dear, no!\nMy darling ZUBAT's LEECH LIFE is so cute I kept using it over and over!\nBut these mean people don't appreciate it at all!"]},{"at":[8,24],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestAudience1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_EXPERT_F","source_id":10,"local_id":10,"source_local":"","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Kiyaaah! You're beautiful, Grandpa!"]},{"at":[18,24],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestAudience4","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_5","source_id":11,"local_id":11,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_AUDIENCE_4","facing":"left","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_LEFT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["When all's said and done, I still love SMARTNESS CONTESTS.\nThat intellectual green color… It's so… So… Cool."]},{"at":[8,22],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_SmartContestAudience2","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_BOY_1","source_id":12,"local_id":12,"source_local":"LOCALID_SMART_AUDIENCE_2","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Even when TRAINERS enter the same kind of POKéMON, they all seem to use different moves for appeals.\nIt's just like the way people have different styles for battling."]},{"at":[24,10],"source_script":"LilycoveCity_ContestHall_EventScript_BeautyContestMC","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_WOMAN_3","source_id":13,"local_id":13,"source_local":"LOCALID_BEAUTY_MC","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["MC: Are you entering th